{
  "repo": "EH3D-NODE-BUNGARD-AUX",
  "ecosystem": "eh3d",
  "tagline": "The node of the drill head of a Bungard CCD machine: video, the height of the table, the speed and the temperature of the spindle.",
  "description": "EH3D-NODE-BUNGARD-AUX is firmware in C++17 for an ESP32-S3 with a wired network port, written for ESP-IDF 5.5. It measures the height of the table with a laser (several readings, the odd ones thrown away), reads the speed and the temperature of the spindle, opens a protect output when the spindle is too fast or too hot, and says it all on the network, with the camera as MJPEG, behind a token. The rules and the words of the network are tested on a computer; the firmware, with the drivers of the laser, of the temperature sensors and of the camera (OV2640 or OV5640), has not been built or run on a board.",
